1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,008
Once upon a time, a tortoise challenged a hare to a race.

2
00:00:07,008 --> 00:00:10,056
The hare laughed and quickly ran far ahead.

3
00:00:10,056 --> 00:00:11,832
He looked back.

4
00:00:11,832 --> 00:00:14,016
The tortoise was nowhere to be seen.

5
00:00:14,016 --> 00:00:16,128
The hare found a cool shady tree.

6
00:00:16,128 --> 00:00:18,048
He decided to take a short rest.

7
00:00:18,048 --> 00:00:21,312
After a short break, he stood up and kept running.

8
00:00:21,312 --> 00:00:23,280
He ran as fast as ever.

9
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:27,336
When the tortoise reached the finish line, the hare was already waiting.

10
00:00:27,336 --> 00:00:32,544
The moral is... Hard work beats talent only when talent stops trying.

